{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e9fe231672d335c38f1de197f454922","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;Hi,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am having a very difficult time deciding on a photographer for my upcoming wedding in May and need to make a decision very soon before they all get booked. &amp;nbsp;Have any of you had amazing photographers at your wedding?&amp;nbsp; If yes, can you private message me links to the photos they took at your wedding?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are looking into Rachel or Jonathan at La Luna, Lori at Sweet Life Photography (used to be called Moments that Matter), Sasha Gluck. We were also looking into Del Sol but all but one of their photographers is already booked.&amp;nbsp; Have any of your worked with Juan Jose at Del Sol?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Has anyone had good experiences with bringing a photographer from the US to Mexico?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do you have any recommendations? &amp;nbsp;Photography is the MOST important item of our wedding and we really want to have wonderful photos so any suggestions or advice would be greatly appreciated!! &lt;span style=\"font-family: wingdings\"&gt;J&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-family: wingdings\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1374511,"PostDate":1294833069,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0Hi,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am having a very difficult time deciding on a photographer for my upcoming wedding in May and need to make a decision very soon before they all get booked. \u00a0Have any of you had amazing photographers at your wedding?\u00a0 If yes, can you private message me links to the photos they took at your wedding?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We are looking into Rachel or Jonathan at La Luna, Lori at Sweet Life Photography (used to be called Moments that Matter), Sasha Gluck. We were also looking into Del Sol but all but one of their photographers is already booked.\u00a0 Have any of your worked with Juan Jose at Del Sol?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Has anyone had good experiences with bringing a photographer from the US to Mexico?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do you have any recommendations? \u00a0Photography is the MOST important item of our wedding and we really want to have wonderful photos so any suggestions or advice would be greatly appreciated!! <span  style=\"font-family: wingdings\">J<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-family: wingdings\">\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissafaybik@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277097071,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229376.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"melfaybik","Id":229376,"Name":"melfaybik","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0f41e4ee64a414d2aef65a55f0844f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;ve worked with all the del Sol photographer &amp;amp; Rachel from La Luna...all fabulous!!! :)&amp;nbsp; I recommend hiring locally because they will know the area better, and possibly be more experienced with beach weddings.&amp;nbsp; Also, my experience working with out of town photographers has been okay, but I&#039;ve never had anyone bring an assistant, which, I think is essential for capturing all the special moments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hope your search goes well! :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1374808,"PostDate":1294850606,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I've worked with all the del Sol photographer & Rachel from La Luna...all fabulous!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I recommend hiring locally because they will know the area better, and possibly be more experienced with beach weddings.\u00a0 Also, my experience working with out of town photographers has been okay, but I've never had anyone bring an assistant, which, I think is essential for capturing all the special moments.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope your search goes well! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"leanne@lmwed.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":44,"GroupName":"Vendor","JoinDate":1224397438,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/9\/99\/99c89c2f_meworking?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LeanneMarie","Id":212324,"Name":"LeanneMarie","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"45e585ceb1b9dde29e770ee7e8b3c758","RawContent":"Hi Leanne, \n \n Del Sol is banned from our resort and we just found out after deciding on booking Rachel from La Luna that she is banned too! :( We are so bummed and now have no idea who to book because all of our backups have already been booked.  Do you have any other recommendations? \n \n Thanks!!! \n \n Melissa\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LeanneMarie[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I&#039;ve worked with all the del Sol photographer &amp;amp; Rachel from La Luna...all fabulous!!! :)  I recommend hiring locally because they will know the area better, and possibly be more experienced with beach weddings.  Also, my experience working with out of town photographers has been okay, but I&#039;ve never had anyone bring an assistant, which, I think is essential for capturing all the special moments.  \n \n Hope your search goes well! :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1381778,"PostDate":1295802376,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Leanne,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Del Sol is banned from our resort and we just found out after deciding on booking Rachel from La Luna that she is banned too! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/> We are so bummed and now have no idea who to book because all of our backups have already been booked.\u00a0 Do you have any other recommendations?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Melissa<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LeanneMarie<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I've worked with all the del Sol photographer & Rachel from La Luna...all fabulous!!! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I recommend hiring locally because they will know the area better, and possibly be more experienced with beach weddings.\u00a0 Also, my experience working with out of town photographers has been okay, but I've never had anyone bring an assistant, which, I think is essential for capturing all the special moments.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope your search goes well! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissafaybik@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1277097071,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229376.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"melfaybik","Id":229376,"Name":"melfaybik","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"563b12b4e585d9c741fb9b4d8b3f606e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; As a matter of fact I just did a trial yesterday and the b2b told me that she has hired Fer Juaristi. She is extremley happy with her choice and I cant wait to work w\/ him! He is a vendor here on BDW. &amp;nbsp;www.ferjuaristi.com, good luck!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1381927,"PostDate":1295815482,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> As a matter of fact I just did a trial yesterday and the b2b told me that she has hired Fer Juaristi. She is extremley happy with her choice and I cant wait to work w\/ him! He is a vendor here on BDW. \u00a0www.ferjuaristi.com, good luck!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mvpbronzegoddess@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.149.1.50","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1294687074,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235357.png?_r=1448541814","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":112,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MVPHairMakeup","Id":235357,"Name":"MVPHairMakeup","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3685d0af941eefb0805702ff0866b19b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have not had a shoot with him yet, but I booked Adrian Herrera of Victor Herrera Photography for my July wedding. &amp;nbsp;His work looks amazing, and they have been wonderful to communicate with so far!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1382837,"PostDate":1295907442,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have not had a shoot with him yet, but I booked Adrian Herrera of Victor Herrera Photography for my July wedding. \u00a0His work looks amazing, and they have been wonderful to communicate with so far!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicola49830@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1294765664,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-235410.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nikkiscriv","Id":235410,"Name":"nikkiscriv","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"36be5b8ee671fb227a82cdaa67e38886","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;I booked Seascha Gluck for my wedding.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This site is a great resource, look at the reviews. Look at their work, find what you like, and look at your budget.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1390270,"PostDate":1296744171,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0I booked Seascha Gluck for my wedding.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This site is a great resource, look at the reviews. Look at their work, find what you like, and look at your budget.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaimee.dupont@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1287270001,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233258.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Avens","Id":233258,"Name":"Avens","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"43c4e0f111466ce40be09f2c98476345","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;Sascha&#039; not Seascha&amp;nbsp; :P&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1390272,"PostDate":1296744199,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0Sascha' not Seascha\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/tongue.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':P' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaimee.dupont@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1287270001,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233258.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":270,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Avens","Id":233258,"Name":"Avens","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6209c16ab99956931c9838899a95a246","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just returned from my wedding in Tulum that was on February 26th.&amp;nbsp; My photographer was Fer Juaristi and he was amazing.&amp;nbsp; Photojournalistic pictures (I think I will receive most of the pictures this week and can send them).&amp;nbsp; But he was the honestly the best decision I made regarding our wedding considering we will have our pictures for a lifetime.&amp;nbsp; I posted a separate review on him on this vednor section this week, so definitely check that out as well.&amp;nbsp; You will be so happy if you hire him!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1412971,"PostDate":1299602428,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just returned from my wedding in Tulum that was on February 26th.\u00a0 My photographer was Fer Juaristi and he was amazing.\u00a0 Photojournalistic pictures (I think I will receive most of the pictures this week and can send them).\u00a0 But he was the honestly the best decision I made regarding our wedding considering we will have our pictures for a lifetime.\u00a0 I posted a separate review on him on this vednor section this week, so definitely check that out as well.\u00a0 You will be so happy if you hire him!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"akurrle@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1268941058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226564.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AKH2011","Id":226564,"Name":"AKH2011","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2925b5d6d83acae5a4ace3fc44dad611","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Why has your resort banned some photograhers?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We used Citlalli of ClaudiaPhoto and loved her and her team! Our pictures were very artistic and natural, which we loved! I&#039;m not one for all the posed, typical wedding shots! Here is the link to my photos on her blog...&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/citlallirico.com\/blog\/?p=2761\"&gt;http:\/\/citlallirico.com\/blog\/?p=2761&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; and my review on this site complete with photos &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/claudiaphoto-wedding-photography\/reviews\/4212\"&gt;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/claudiaphoto-wedding-photography\/reviews\/4212&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; Good Luck in your search!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1413016,"PostDate":1299604720,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Why has your resort banned some photograhers?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We used Citlalli of ClaudiaPhoto and loved her and her team! Our pictures were very artistic and natural, which we loved! I'm not one for all the posed, typical wedding shots! Here is the link to my photos on her blog...<a href='http:\/\/citlallirico.com\/blog\/?p=2761' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/citlallirico.com\/blog\/?p=2761<\/a>\u00a0 and my review on this site complete with photos <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/products\/claudiaphoto-wedding-photography\/reviews\/4212' class='bbc_url' title=''>http:\/\/www.bestdesti...hy\/reviews\/4212<\/a>\u00a0 Good Luck in your search!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lindsey_macrae@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"198.161.230.11","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1267568319,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-226095.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CanadianLindsey","Id":226095,"Name":"CanadianLindsey","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"339862636786a6810e473823d19cf323","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey everyone!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am new to the site and looking to get married at the iberostar. Just wondering who a good photographer is for a great price? Can you guys please inform me approx how much i should budget for a photographer?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1414788,"PostDate":1299792576,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey everyone!!<\/p> <p> I am new to the site and looking to get married at the iberostar. Just wondering who a good photographer is for a great price? Can you guys please inform me approx how much i should budget for a photographer?<\/p> <p> Thanks<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"courtneypfeifer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1299678018,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237607.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"canmaya bride","Id":237607,"Name":"canmaya bride","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":257,"TotalPages":26,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":250},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
