{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df0b4f5954919eb1703b4a5cfe7459a4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; What kind of price did you get from them?&amp;nbsp; Also is there a group of photographers or just 2 in this company.&amp;nbsp; They do really nice photos!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1428348,"PostDate":1301759741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> What kind of price did you get from them?\u00a0 Also is there a group of photographers or just 2 in this company.\u00a0 They do really nice photos!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"Afaybik@comcast.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1276196111,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229063.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Afaybik","Id":229063,"Name":"Afaybik","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e7eb9620ab1f83ee2de31096dab08fb","RawContent":"\n &lt;p&gt; Hands down, the best ever - you&#039;ll be so&amp;nbsp;&lt;strike&gt; &lt;\/strike&gt;ecstatic if you can get them, is..........Moments That Matter Photography - bar NONE.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Check them out, and you&#039;ll see what I mean.........and you&#039;ll be so happy you did :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1428632,"PostDate":1301847220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <p> Hands down, the best ever - you'll be so\u00a0<strike> <\/strike>ecstatic if you can get them, is..........Moments That Matter Photography - bar NONE.<\/p> <p> Check them out, and you'll see what I mean.........and you'll be so happy you did <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lesandlynda@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1285527609,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232679.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mockingbird101","Id":232679,"Name":"mockingbird101","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5185b12493f3a387c904da3219ea804f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; LOVE LOVE LOVE Sascha Gluck!!!&amp;nbsp; He did our wedding in February and he is amazing!&amp;nbsp; We absolutely love our wedding photos and are so glad we chose him.&amp;nbsp; &lt;img alt=\"NG (358 _.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/363107\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1428719,"PostDate":1301866359,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> LOVE LOVE LOVE Sascha Gluck!!!\u00a0 He did our wedding in February and he is amazing!\u00a0 We absolutely love our wedding photos and are so glad we chose him.\u00a0 <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"NG (358 _.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/363107\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nikki62500@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1286994349,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233175.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nikki62500","Id":233175,"Name":"nikki62500","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5bed387a977357aaae599801592afdb2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I used Gonzalo, he is a great photographer. His prices are in my budget!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; take a look at his blog www.gonzalonunez.com\/blog&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Nicole&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":4785,"Name":"Fan Program.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-27091-138237777651.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_04_2011\/post-27091-138237777651_thumb.jpg","Width":640,"Height":480}],"Id":1428839,"PostDate":1301906183,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I used Gonzalo, he is a great photographer. His prices are in my budget!<\/p> <p> take a look at his blog www.gonzalonunez.com\/blog<\/p> <p> Nicole<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicole-woods@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1301904797,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238505.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"nicole-woods","Id":238505,"Name":"nicole-woods","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"56626441db05bbc4cd8c6fbc4f722c85","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Melissa - I would highly recommend Michael &amp;amp; Jennifer Lewis (&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.mandjphoto.com\"&gt;http:\/\/www.mandjphoto.com&lt;\/a&gt;). They photographed my wedding in Denver, CO and now live in Mexico. Here is a description of&amp;nbsp;each of their styles.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Michael has worked as a professional photographer since 1981, shooting for such prestigious publications as National Geographic, Smithsonian and TIME. He has worked in more than 45 countries and photographed weddings around the U.S. and in Mexico. He tends to work in a photojournalistic style, unobtrusive, but always \u00e2\u20ac\u0153there\u00e2\u20ac\u009d.\n \n Jennifer\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s style is elegant and artistic. She was trained in classic portraiture at Brooks Institute in California, one of the finest photography schools in the world. Having worked on projects in India and South America, she also has photographed weddings in the U.S. and Mexico. Like Michael, she regularly contributes photos to the National Geographic Image Collection. She creates portraits and captures moments that every bride treasures.\n \n I know Michael personally and he is a great guy! I met Jennifer when she photographed my wedding and she is also awesome. They make a great pair! They are easy to work with and are&amp;nbsp;very talented. Definitely check them out!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; - Laura&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1433692,"PostDate":1302632363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Melissa - I would highly recommend Michael & Jennifer Lewis (<a href='http:\/\/www.mandjphoto.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.mandjphoto.com<\/a>). They photographed my wedding in Denver, CO and now live in Mexico. Here is a description of\u00a0each of their styles.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Michael has worked as a professional photographer since 1981, shooting for such prestigious publications as National Geographic, Smithsonian and TIME. He has worked in more than 45 countries and photographed weddings around the U.S. and in Mexico. He tends to work in a photojournalistic style, unobtrusive, but always \u00e2\u20ac\u0153there\u00e2\u20ac\u009d.<br \/> <br \/> Jennifer\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s style is elegant and artistic. She was trained in classic portraiture at Brooks Institute in California, one of the finest photography schools in the world. Having worked on projects in India and South America, she also has photographed weddings in the U.S. and Mexico. Like Michael, she regularly contributes photos to the National Geographic Image Collection. She creates portraits and captures moments that every bride treasures.<br \/> <br \/> I know Michael personally and he is a great guy! I met Jennifer when she photographed my wedding and she is also awesome. They make a great pair! They are easy to work with and are\u00a0very talented. Definitely check them out!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> - Laura<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brandt_laura@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1302631461,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238802.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LBrandt","Id":238802,"Name":"LBrandt","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"23af0bdf6bc0edcb8b8d536cb97f28e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Just booked mine :)&amp;nbsp; We are using Samuel Luna.&amp;nbsp; His work is really amazing!&amp;nbsp; Check it out &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.samuelluna.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.samuelluna.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1433963,"PostDate":1302682315,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just booked mine <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 We are using Samuel Luna.\u00a0 His work is really amazing!\u00a0 Check it out <a href='http:\/\/www.samuelluna.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.samuelluna.com\/<\/a><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"christine.vanlunen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1295875146,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/4\/41\/419c1066_user-35394-avatar?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":107,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cvan8765","Id":235931,"Name":"cvan8765","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"faa4d293c6a7a0e2b020f38f12b8eed4","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are using Juan Navarro for photography.&amp;nbsp; His work is absolutely amazing &amp;amp; the prices are very reasonable!&amp;nbsp; Photography is definitely one of the most important aspects of our wedding, especially since it&#039;ll just be the two of us.&amp;nbsp; We are receiving 3 hours of photography on the wedding day with Juan &amp;amp; an assistant, 160 prints total, an album, photo&#039;s in high res on dvd,, plus a ttd session the next day for 2 hours with 55 prints and photo&#039;s on dvd for $1800.&amp;nbsp; I believe he is well worth the cost, his photo&#039;s are great and I have yet to see any bad reviews about him.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Good luck!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1433992,"PostDate":1302686758,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are using Juan Navarro for photography.\u00a0 His work is absolutely amazing & the prices are very reasonable!\u00a0 Photography is definitely one of the most important aspects of our wedding, especially since it'll just be the two of us.\u00a0 We are receiving 3 hours of photography on the wedding day with Juan & an assistant, 160 prints total, an album, photo's in high res on dvd,, plus a ttd session the next day for 2 hours with 55 prints and photo's on dvd for $1800.\u00a0 I believe he is well worth the cost, his photo's are great and I have yet to see any bad reviews about him.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Good luck!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lsteward612@att.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1287757885,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-233417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"royalbride610","Id":233417,"Name":"royalbride610","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":58966,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9950eb6ffee39836290682d21403be9f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m a photographer in Texas and I know Fer Juaristi is an amazing photographer. He or any of his collegues in the WedRockers. Check his website out and Daniel Aguilar - they are both super amazing and very down to earth people.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1434143,"PostDate":1302701599,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm a photographer in Texas and I know Fer Juaristi is an amazing photographer. He or any of his collegues in the WedRockers. Check his website out and Daniel Aguilar - they are both super amazing and very down to earth people.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"monica.salazar@live.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":12